    }), [Fact.key_of("is", "n")]), "a firing that makes a point no local held - behind a ray at a meeting, ahead of a ray with nowhere to step - grows the world by it, at its own rate, through its own gates, the count written on it. This is the room the world gains per local per tick: what it expands by", Ops.m_concat(Ops.m_map(used, ->(n) {
      return "#{n} = #{Expr.show(Expr.num(Ops.elem(fill, n)))}"
    }), ["#{lhs} = #{Expr.show(rhs)}"]))
